  "reflectionText": "Daniel set his face to the Lord with fasting and sackcloth and ashes, and cried: O Lord, hear. O Lord, forgive. O Lord, listen and do. Gabriel came to him at the time of the evening offering and said: at the beginning of your petitions the commandment went out. What is the hurt of confessing the sins of your people on their behalf, while the answer is already on its way to your room?"
